{"created": "2024-08-02T14:08:22.042672+00:00", "modified": "2025-04-11T14:22:47.770187+00:00", "id": 13170795, "conceptrecid": "11408925", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.13170795", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.11408925", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.13170795", "metadata": {"title": "Underwater images collected by  Scuba diving in St-Gilles, R\u00e9union - 2015-06-11", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.13170795", "publication_date": "2025-04-11", "description": "<i>This dataset was collected by  Scuba diving in St-Gilles, R\u00e9union - 2015-06-11.</i> <br>\n\n            <br><br>Underwater or aerial images collected by scientists or citizens can have a wide variety of use for science, management, or conservation.\n            These images can be annotated and shared to train IA models which can in turn predict the objects on the images.\n            We provide a set of tools (hardware and software) to collect marine data, predict species or habitat, and provide maps.<br>\n\n\n            Underwater Images Collected by Scuba Diving in R\u00e9union Island during the Hyscores Project. <br>\n            For more details, visit the <a href=\"https://archimer.ifremer.fr/doc/00350/46122/\" target=\"_blank\">Hyscores Project</a>.<br><br>\n\n\n            <h2> Generic folder structure </h2>\n            \n            YYYYMMDD_COUNTRYCODE-optionalplace_device_session-number <br>\n            \u251c\u2500\u2500 DCIM :  folder to store videos and photos depending on the media collected. <br>\n            \u251c\u2500\u2500 GPS :  folder to store any positioning related file. If any kind of correction is possible on files (e.g. Post-Processed Kinematic thanks to rinex data) then the distinction between device data and base data is made. If, on the other hand, only device position data are present and the files cannot be corrected by post-processing techniques (e.g. gpx files), then the distinction between base and device is not made and the files are placed directly at the root of the GPS folder. <br>\n            \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 BASE :  files coming from rtk station or any static positioning instrument. <br>\n            \u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 DEVICE : files coming from the device. <br>\n            \u251c\u2500\u2500 METADATA : folder with general information files about the session. <br>\n            \u251c\u2500\u2500 PROCESSED_DATA : contain all the folders needed to store the results of the data processing of the current session. <br>\n            \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 BATHY :  output folder for bathymetry raw data extracted from mission logs. <br>\n            \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 FRAMES :  output folder for georeferenced frames extracted from DCIM videos. <br>\n            \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 IA :  destination folder for image recognition predictions. <br>\n            \u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 PHOTOGRAMMETRY :  destination folder for reconstructed models in photogrammetry. <br>\n            \u2514\u2500\u2500 SENSORS : folder to store files coming from other sources (bathymetry data from the echosounder, log file from the autopilot,  mission plan etc.). <br>      \n            \n\n            <h2> Software </h2>\n            <br> All the raw data was processed using our <a href=\"https://github.com/SeatizenDOI/plancha-workflow/releases/tag/v1.0.3\" target=\"_blank\">worflow</a>. <br>All predictions were generated by our <a href=\"https://github.com/SeatizenDOI/plancha-inference/releases/tag/v1.0.0\" target=\"_blank\">inference pipeline</a>. <br>You can find all the necessary scripts to download this data in this <a href=\"https://github.com/SeatizenDOI/zenodo-tools\" target=\"_blank\">repository</a>. <br>Enjoy your data with <a href=\"https://github.com/SeatizenDOI\" target=\"_blank\">SeatizenDOI</a>! <br>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Pascal Mouquet", "affiliation": "Ifremer DOI, La R\u00e9union, France", "orcid": "0000-0003-0361-4131"}, {"name": "Touria Bajjouk", "affiliation": "Ifremer, Brest, France", "orcid": "0000-0001-9039-0660"}, {"name": "Michel Ropert", "affiliation": "Ifremer DOI, La R\u00e9union, France", "orcid": "0000-0002-5837-6268"}, {"name": "Laurence Maurel", "affiliation": "Kart'eau, La R\u00e9union, France"}], "contributors": [{"name": "Victor Illien", "affiliation": "Ifremer DOI, La R\u00e9union, France", "type": "DataManager", "orcid": "0009-0007-2143-8027"}], "keywords": ["Artificial Intelligence", "Citizen Sciences", "Coral Reef", "Coral Reef Habitat", "Ecology", "Global Coral Reef Monitoring Network", "Hyscores", "Indian Ocean", "Mapping", "Reef Ecosystem", "R\u00e9union", "SCUBA", "Scuba diving"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.11125847", "relation": "isMetadataFor", "resource_type": "dataset", "scheme": "url"}], "version": "RAW_DATA", "language": "eng", "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "alternate_identifiers": [{"identifier": "urn:20150611_REU-St-Gilles_scuba"}], "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "communities": [{"id": "seatizen-data"}], "relations": {"version": [{"index": 2, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "11408925"}}]}, "notes": "Internal fund by IFREMER.<br>"}, "title": "Underwater images collected by  Scuba diving in St-Gilles, R\u00e9union - 2015-06-11", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/13170795", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/13170795", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/13170795?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.13170795", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.13170795", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.13170795", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/13170795/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/11408925", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/11408925", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.11408925", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.11408925", "self_ii